@startuml rayai_dynamic_collaboration
title RayAI - Dynamic Agent Collaboration (Discovery-Based)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam participantPadding 15
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

' ==================== PARTICIPANTS ====================
box "RayAI Platform" #LightBlue
    participant "Orchestrator\n(Ray Runtime)" as Orch #SkyBlue
end box

box "Agent Pool" #LightGreen
    participant "Agent A\n(Claude Code)" as A #PaleGreen
    participant "Agent B\n(Claude Code)" as B #PaleGreen
    participant "Agent C\n(Available)" as C #LightGray
end box

box "Infrastructure" #LightYellow
    database "Shared Context\n(Ray Object Store)" as Store
    participant "gVisor Sandbox" as Sandbox #Wheat
end box

' ==================== INITIAL TASK ====================
== User Submits Task ==

[-> Orch : "Implement data download feature"
Orch -> A : assign_task()
activate A

A -> Sandbox : execute code
activate Sandbox
Sandbox --> A : running...

== Dynamic Discovery (NOT Pre-defined!) ==

note over A #LightCoral
  **Claude Code discovers issue:**
  "This code needs to run in a container
  for production deployment.
  I should delegate this to a DevOps agent."

  **This is NOT pre-coded logic!**
  Claude autonomously recognizes the need.
end note

A -> A : Claude thinks:\n"Need containerization,\nbut I'm focused on\ndata download logic"

== Autonomous Delegation ==

A -> Store : **report_discovery()**\n{\n  "issue": "needs_containerization",\n  "context": code_snapshot,\n  "reason": "production deployment"\n}
activate Store
Store --> A : discovery_ref
deactivate Store

A -> Orch : **request_collaboration()**\n"Need DevOps expertise\nfor containerization"
activate Orch

note over Orch #LightBlue
  **Orchestrator decides:**
  • Find agent with DevOps skills
  • Agent B is available
  • Assign sub-task
end note

Orch -> B : assign_subtask(discovery_ref)
deactivate Orch
activate B

A -> A : **Continue working**\non data download\n(non-blocking)

note right of A #PaleGreen
  Agent A doesn't stop!
  Continues other aspects
  of the feature.
end note

== Agent B Works ==

B -> Store : get(discovery_ref)
Store --> B : context + code

B -> Sandbox : execute containerization
Sandbox --> B : Dockerfile, docker-compose

B -> Store : put(containerization_result)
Store --> B : result_ref

== Completion & Integration ==

B -> Orch : **task_complete(result_ref)**
deactivate B
Orch -> A : **notify_completion(result_ref)**

A -> Store : get(result_ref)
Store --> A : containerization_result

A -> A : Integrate containerization\ninto feature

A -> Sandbox : final testing
Sandbox --> A : all tests pass
deactivate Sandbox

A --> Orch : **feature_complete()**
deactivate A

[<-- Orch : "Data download feature ready\n(with containerization)"

@enduml
